Route27_Interior1_Text_OldWoman_1::
	.string "Where are you off to with POKéMON?\p"
	.string "POKéMON LEAGUE?\p"
	.string "Are your POKéMON loyal enough for\n"
	.string "you to win?\p"
	.string "Let me see...$"

Route27_Interior1_Text_OldWoman_2::
	.string "If it doesn’t come to trust you some\n"
	.string "more, it could be tough going.\p"
	.string "Trust is the tie that binds POKéMON\n"
	.string "and trainers.$"

Route27_Interior1_Text_OldWoman_3::
	.string "TM37 happens to be SANDSTORM.\p"
	.string "It’s a move that inflicts damage on\n"
	.string "both battlers.\p"
	.string "It’s for advanced trainers only.\n"
	.string "Use it if you dare. Good luck!$"

Route27_Interior1_Text_OldWoman_4::
	.string "Ah! Your POKéMON trusts you very\n"
	.string "much.\p"
	.string "It’s nice to see a good trainer.\p"
	.string "Here. A gift for your journey.$"
